      "content": "the hybrid model sounds okay in theory but it's super expensive. if i have to choose just one for the memo to show a clear direction, which one actually holds up better against major economic shocks? i need to know if we should be leaning towards the simplicity of UBI or the efficiency of targeted programs.",
